# Sites of scripts/check-capacity.sh that are bounded some other way. RULE, PATH, the text of the line, the reason: one tab between them.
# A line that matches no site fails the check, so this list shrinks with the code. A site that is not bounded is fixed, not listed.
array-append	src/agg/chunkfilter.c	fl->leaf[fl->n++] = f->leaf;	the conjuncts offered are cut at SIFT_COLSRC_MAX_FILTERS (agg/init_filter.c), the arrays are allocated for that many; the pair array holds the two ends of one range
