cast-after-product	src/col/maint/roll.c	return (uint64) (live * Max(hi - lo, 0.0) / ((double) v->khi[i] + 1 - (double) v->klo[i]));	a double estimate, the cast truncates it; the array is the directory entries, at most SIFT_DIR_WIDE_MAX
